:: OC Patrick and Jackson [nobr]

/* Intro */
<span style="Color: pink">Playing in the rain in just your underwear is fun and liberating, though you are careful to stay out of direct sight from the cafeteria.</span> You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> are in the middle of a rousing game of jumping in big puddles <span style="Color: Yellow">when <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> suddenly smiles and begins waving towards the cafeteria.</span> <br>

