<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey! Can I play too?”</span> You turn and see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> , shirt already off, <span style="Color: pink">as he strips down to join you both.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Of course!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> replies back happily, overjoyed to now have two playmates. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> <span style="Color: pink">strips down to his underwear, which is a big, white diaper, and runs over playfully. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> pauses upon seeing what <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> is wearing, tilting his head.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Why are you wearing that? It looks weird.”</span> <br>

