<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It’s super comfy!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> responds, <span style="Color: pink">thrusting his pelvis forward and inviting <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> to pat his padded crotch,</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Soft, cozy, and super convenient! I can go potty without having to stop playing!”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It is soft.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> <span style="Color: pink">laughs, enjoying the feeling of the wet fabric crinkling in his fingers as rain continues to make it sag,</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But I normally just pee in a bush. I thought only babies wore diapers.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“No way! Diapers are great! They keep my butt nice and comfy in class and when I pee in them, it keeps me warm!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> explains, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I have some spares if you wanna try! Trust me, their great!”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hmmm…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> thinks for a moment, <span style="Color: pink">patting the diaper a few more times,</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Maybe later. I don’t have to pee right now.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> nods and the three of you head off to play. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> <span style="Color: pink">seems to have taken the reveal of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> ’s diaper very well. He seemed unsure about wearing one himself, though you get the feeling that has more to do with his desire to not wear anymore clothes than he already has to.</span> <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Jump around in the puddles<br>">>
	<<replace"#choice">>
        <span style="Color: pink">The three of you begin to jump and splash around in the puddles, enjoying the wet smacking sound and the surge of water that comes up as you do it. You take turns trying to make the biggest splash. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> is a natural at this, but <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> gives him a run for his money. <br>
        <br>
        The longer you do this, the more you notice <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> ’s diaper surge with water and expand, now nearly twice the size and sagging down on his waist. Then, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> stops with a certain look on his face. The look of a boy who suddenly realized he had to pee and just stopped to do it. No shame, no hesitation, just peeing himself right there in front of you. As he relieves himself, the diaper finally gives way and collapses to the ground in a wet heap, the urine the final breaking point. <br>

