        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Wha-!? Did it break?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> asks in confusion of the fallen diaper. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Nah. I guess it can’t handle being wet on the outside AND the inside.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> laughs. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> looks on in slight confusion for a moment before getting what <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> is saying and suddenly laughs. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Haha! You peed! I didn’t even notice! That’s cool!”</span> <span style="Color: pink"><span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> both break out laughing at this, finding <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span>’s exposure extremely funny and hilarious. As <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> runs to get a new diaper from his bag, you notice <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> eyeing the wet mush of diaper on the ground. You get the feeling the idea of it suddenly falling apart, leaving him nude, is a good sell for him to wear one.</span> <br>
